      "id": "mq9pcj48y1r",
      "text": "Blood relation",
      "collapsed": true,
      "important": false,
      "note": "========== FAMILY TREE SHORT NOTES ==========\n\n📌 GENERATION LEVELS\nGrandparents   ↑ Level 1\nParents        ↑ Level 2\nChildren       ↑ Level 3\nGrandchildren  ↑ Level 4\n\n\n📌 SYMBOLS\nMale → +     Female → -     Unknown → ?\n\n\n📌 POSITION RULES\nParents → Above (↑)\nChildren → Below (↓)\nSiblings → Same level(A — B)\nSpouse → Side (A = B)\n\n\n📌 EXAMPLE\n\nA and B are husband and wife.\nA is father of C and D.\nD is mother of E.\nE is son of F.\n\nStep-wise Tree:\n\nA (+) = B (-)\n   │\n-------------\n│          │\nC (?) — D (-) = F (+)\n               │\n              E (+)",
      "youtube": "",
